      "after": {
        "exists": true,
        "value": "The Latin places “easdem” (“those same offerings”), the object of “accipias” (“accept”), before the phrase about angelic intercession. The intercession applies to both requests: that God, appeased, accept these offerings and grant that they contribute to our salvation."
